      "content": "it's not just the phone calls though. it's everything. every door i try to open just gets slammed in my face. i feel like i'm fighting a ghost or something. it's like if the records say i'm not there, then i'm really not. i'm just a glitch in their machine. how am i supposed to keep trying when the world has already decided i don't exist?",
